    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Brief:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You are inside a sublunar capsule, descending automatically into the Moon\u2019s depths.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>As you Descend, you will encounter various Anomalies, most of which are harmless. However, if you spot  potentially Dangerous Anomalies, immediately change your route and submit a Report.\u00a0</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>How to Play? Just answer next question:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Have you noticed any potentially Dangerous Anomalies?</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yes --&gt; Submit a report immediately and change your route.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No\u00a0 --&gt; Continue your Descent.</strong></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VHS Atmosphere\u00a0</strong> [real-time noise and visual distortion]</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Camera\u00a0\u00a0</strong>[slight &quot;shaky&quot; camera effect for immersion]</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hidden Endings\u00a0</strong>\u00a0[multiple finales based on your decisions]</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333180/extras/4222a30337ebeaa80cf1cb9a74ef7781.poster.avif?t=1753121759\" width=720 height=404 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333180/extras/4222a30337ebeaa80cf1cb9a74ef7781.webm?t=1753121759\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3333180/extras/4222a30337ebeaa80cf1cb9a74ef7781.mp4?t=1753121759\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Notes:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Playtime: 1-3 Hours</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by projects like <i>&quot;Iron Lung&quot;</i> and <i>&quot;Exit 8&quot;</i>.</strong></p>",
